    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9958" root="خبل" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَابِلٌ</span></b>  <i>Corrupting, rendering unsound, vitiating,</i>
or <i>disordering,</i> [<i>in an absolute sense;</i>] (M, K;)
and particularly <i>in the reason,</i> or <i>intellect.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَلٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  It is also
added to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبْلٌ</span> to give intensiveness to the signification. (TA.)

